WEBVTT

00:08:29.836 --> 00:08:31.756
like blended finance,

00:08:31.756 --> 00:08:35.556
that can help to augment
public-private partnerships

00:08:35.556 --> 00:08:39.476
and collaboration with development
finance institutions.

00:08:40.116 --> 00:08:41.396
But you know what?

00:08:41.756 --> 00:08:43.876
I think that we're also
going to have to make

00:08:43.876 --> 00:08:46.516
some behavioral changes within ourselves.

00:08:47.556 --> 00:08:50.236
Like addressing our ambiguity bias

00:08:50.236 --> 00:08:53.836
that causes us to financially undervalue

00:08:53.876 --> 00:08:57.276
anything that seems foreign or complex.

00:08:57.956 --> 00:09:02.756
(Applause)